========================================================
Run parameters for the anasum stage
========================================================

========================================================
All lines without a '*' in the first column are ignored!
--------------------------------------------------------

Time mask
---------
* TIMEMASKFILE timemask.dat

Exclusion regions
-----------------
* REGIONTOEXCLUDE 0. 0. 0.40
* BRIGHTSTARCATALOGUE Hipparcos_MAG8_1997.dat
* BRIGHTSTARSETTINGS 8 0.25 B

Sky maps
--------
binning of sky map (correlated plots) [deg]
* SKYMAPBINSIZE 0.01
binning of sky map (uncorrelated plots) [deg]
* SKYMAPBINSIZEUC 0.05
size of sky map (x-axis/declination axis) [deg]
* SKYMAPSIZEX 2.
size of sky map (y-axis/RA axis) [deg]
* SKYMAPSIZEY 2.
sky map centre
* SKYMAPCENTRE_RADECJ2000_HOUR 04 40 59.33 44 31 49.3
target position
* TARGETPOSITION_RADECJ2000_HOUR 04 40 59.33 44 31 49.3

Spectral reconstruction
-----------------------
* ENERGYSPECTRALINDEX 4.0
Energy spectra binning (logarithmic axis)
* ENERGYBINSIZE 0.05
* DEADTIMECALCULATIONMETHOD 0
